      "valence": "Positive",
      "description": "Other friendly units within 12\u0022 may use rules that pick friendly units as if they were in this unit\u0027s position, so a 12\u0022 pick reaches targets up to 24\u0022 away. Applies to unit picks, not to spells."
    },
